# Fixture: Europe base (60000 gold, tax 6%, difficulty 0) with a Galleon (6 holds) in the harbor (selected), loaded
# Tobacco 100 / Silver 30 / Cotton 50 / Rum 60 / Ore 100 / Furs 100. Silver price-pressure word set to 50 (fall step at 100) so one
# 30-ton sale (30<<2 = 120) pushes it over and raises @PRICEDOWN. Hold i is at x = 152+12i, y 171; market cell i at x = 10+19i, y 189.
# Sale = (bid-1)*tons gross, tax = 6% (floor) cut from it, net credited, status line "N Good sold for G. 6% Tax: T. Net: M".
key e                    # open the European Status screen
wait 10
drag 152 171 100 100     # hold dropped on the sky, not the market: nothing sold
# Drag route: a whole hold onto the market strip sells all of it.
drag 152 171 48 189      # Tobacco 100 @ 4 = 400, tax 24, net 376
drag 164 171 143 189     # Silver 30 @ 19 = 570, tax 34, net 536; Silver bid 20 -> 19: @PRICEDOWN
key Return               # OK the popup
# Keyboard route: '-' sells the WHOLE first hold of the selected market cell's good (FUN_38fd_23c4), '_' asks the amount.
click 67 189             # select the Cotton market cell
key -                    # Cotton 50 @ 4 = 200, tax 12, net 188
key -                    # no Cotton aboard now: red bar "No Cotton in cargo hold!", nothing sold
# Shift+drag asks @HOWMUCH5 first (prompt starts at the full hold, 100).
drag 200 171 124 189 shift
key Backspace
key Backspace
key Backspace
key 2
key 5
key Return               # 25 Ore @ 3 = 75, tax 4, net 71
click 181 189            # select the Rum market cell
key - shift              # '_' = Shift+'-': asks the amount first (@HOWMUCH5 over the first Rum hold, prompt starts at 60)
key Backspace
key Backspace
key 1
key 0
key Return               # 10 Rum @ 12 = 120, tax 7, net 113
# U sells ONE hold per press, the lowest key first (FUN_479b_0f60: key = (price << 4) * tons; Ore 3*16*75, Furs 5*16*100, Rum 12*16*50).
key u                    # Ore 75 @ 3 = 225
key u                    # Furs 100 @ 5 = 500
# The ship menu's row 3 unloads whatever is left, last hold first.
click 153 155            # the Galleon's icon: ship menu (4 rows)
click 150 109            # row 3 Unload all cargo: Rum 50
key Return               # OK the Rum @PRICEDOWN popup (Rum 10 + 50 tons crossed the fall step)
key u                    # empty ship: red bar "No cargo on board!" (queued behind the sale lines)
wait 130
shot
key e                    # leave Europe
